{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:40 2026-05-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:40 2026-05-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:40 2026-05-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"母親節前夕，花店逼滿人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e237c6c881fef3565b0be933b99c80da/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_12.jpg\"/><p>周日（10日）是母親節，不少市民會買花送給母親或妻子表達謝意，旺角花墟逼滿人，有市民亦會選擇與母親外出飽餐一頓，慰勞她們平日的辛勞，有餐廳推出母親節大餐招徠。</p><p>攝影 : 陳浩元</p><img alt=\"母親節前夕，花店逼滿人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d7dec86e78e61d08e2080680c99d5ae6/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_01.jpg\"/><img alt=\"不少市民母親節會選擇購買花束送予媽媽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/feadf4de428d1b46e92ff6cc56469a5a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"不少市民會買花送給母親或妻子表達謝意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2cf8f4c070422c1eeeb1303b3548223c/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"不少市民會買花送給母親或妻子表達謝意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/22033f56ce5c2b3cf4a481a0672d3534/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_11.jpg\"/><img alt=\"有市民會選擇與母親外出飽餐一頓，慰勞她們平日的辛勞，有餐廳推出母親節大餐招徠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/377e5b91bc83b525eb064fe362c6d1af/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc90dcb54f6e7211375330d1bef25762/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_13.jpg\"/><img alt=\"明日是母親節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/84e81be983210c89bc7639605bdf99fc/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_165002978_09.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-09T11:01:36.472168+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}